WEBVTT

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:03.104
Settings → Workspace members lists everyone

00:00:03.104 --> 00:00:05.663
Open the invite dialog

00:00:05.663 --> 00:00:09.465
Enter the email

00:00:09.465 --> 00:00:15.106
Choose permissions

00:00:15.106 --> 00:00:17.649
Send: click Invite Member

00:00:17.649 --> 00:00:19.451
The new member appears as Pending

00:00:19.451 --> 00:00:27.069
Change anyone's access from their row

00:00:27.069 --> 00:00:30.612
Company details holds your KYC for billing

00:00:30.612 --> 00:00:35.783
Workspace logs: who changed what, and when
